  "reason": "The same work and change are already saved as item 8 in decisions.md, 'Hand-forwarding daily market reports to the Portland floor' ($39.95 a month), which cites the same williams-w3 messages; the draft's own figure of 21 times a month at 13 minutes is also not supported, since the archive shows 7 Energy Market Report forwards and only 2 Gas Daily sends in about 9 days.",
