  "change": "Have each person record their own time off in the timekeeping system when it happens, so the assistant only reviews a list of exceptions instead of collecting email replies.",
  "reason": "The same work and the same change are already saved in decisions.md as \"Pay-period time reports for the Transwestern commercial group\", which cites the same Lokay time-report messages.",
  "research": null
